<title>ITALY: Italy tax receipts up 8.7 pct Jan-Aug - FinMin.</title>
<headline>Italy tax receipts up 8.7 pct Jan-Aug - FinMin.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian tax receipts rose 8.7 percent in the first eight months of the year to 334.559 trillion lire compared with the same period in 1995, the Finance Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The ministry said that in August alone, tax returns rose 6.7 percent to 35.167 trillion lire.</p>
